1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,760
 Some may be crying out right now with words like,

2
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:07,400
 "Oh God, where art thou?

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,840
 My child is struggling.

4
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:12,000
 Take comfort.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,880
 God hears you and will answer your prayers in his own time

6
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:17,680
 and in his own way.

7
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:20,480
 Keep your covenants, strive to be faithful,

8
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:24,120
 and cheerfully do all things lie in your power.

9
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:28,120
 And then may you stand still with the utmost assurance

10
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:35,120
 to see the salvation of God, and for his arm to be revealed.

11
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:39,120
 I testify that the infinite power of God is in our comfort.

